  "hypothesis": "The actual opt-in V15 release-batch Backend can route a focus-bound W hold through a detached InputOwnerProcess and, after session-only SIGKILL, produce normal verified release, independent X KeyRelease/keymap-up, fsynced receipt, and clean owner exit while the supervisor keeps Xvfb alive.",
