  "decision_rule": "PASS_METHOD_SCOPED requires backend ready identity, independent KeyPress and keymap-down before session SIGKILL, session return -9, independent KeyRelease and keymap-up after kill, receipt identity match with trigger rpc_eof, recovery_verified and receipt_fsynced true, stopped owner thread, all owner releases verified empty with final reason close, service exit 0 without forced owner termination, and Xvfb controlled exit -15.",
